                                                "sense_id": "a54ca83b-897e-35ac-9243-5035f85a1d0f",
                                                "text": "107. THE LOW FRANCONIAN.—This was spoken on the lower Rhine. The oldest monument in it is the so-called Malberg (i.e. mahal-berg 'mount of justice') Gloss, i.e. Franconian vocables entered as glosses into the Salic Code of Law written in Latin."
